WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.730
Looking for open-source software?

00:00:02.230 --> 00:00:04.230
Want to support the tools you love and use?

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:05.980
Meet FOSS Index.

00:00:06.380 --> 00:00:08.850
Discover open-source software in one place.

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:12.210
Desktop apps. self-hosted services. operating systems.

00:00:13.170 --> 00:00:16.700
Find tools by category. or browse by tag.

00:00:16.700 --> 00:00:18.420
like everything self-hosted.

00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:20.830
Or search for what you need.

00:00:21.470 --> 00:00:23.100
From Joplin on your desktop.

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:24.700
to Audiobookshelf on your server.

00:00:24.800 --> 00:00:26.500
to NixOS on your next machine.

00:00:27.520 --> 00:00:29.700
Open a listing for its license. the recorded release.

00:00:29.700 --> 00:00:31.530
and the platforms it runs on.

00:00:31.850 --> 00:00:32.900
What it needs is right up front.

00:00:33.370 --> 00:00:34.590
The details stay one tap away.

00:00:35.910 --> 00:00:37.340
Save tools for later. right in your browser.

00:00:37.710 --> 00:00:38.380
No account needed.

00:00:39.220 --> 00:00:42.070
Discovering open-source software is one part of FOSS Index.

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:43.990
Supporting the people who make it is the other.

00:00:44.600 --> 00:00:46.340
If a project helps you. help it keep going.

00:00:46.940 --> 00:00:49.080
Look for Support this project on its listing.

00:00:49.650 --> 00:00:52.760
When a funding link is available. it takes you
to the project's own support page.

00:00:53.260 --> 00:00:55.000
Your support goes through the maintainer's own channels.

00:00:55.000 --> 00:00:56.720
FOSS Index doesn't take a cut.

00:00:57.220 --> 00:01:00.220
Want to support open source. but not sure
which project to donate to?

00:01:00.660 --> 00:01:01.340
Hit Surprise me.

00:01:01.680 --> 00:01:02.800
It opens a random project:

00:01:03.120 --> 00:01:04.040
something new to discover.

00:01:04.430 --> 00:01:05.680
and maybe the next one you'll support.

00:01:06.640 --> 00:01:07.860
And of course. there's dark mode.

00:01:08.260 --> 00:01:09.210
Your retinas will thank you.

00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:12.060
FOSS Index. from FOSSadmin.

00:01:12.440 --> 00:01:13.700
Discover open-source.

00:01:13.800 --> 00:01:14.860
Support the projects.
